<title>USA: Cyclone Gretelle to hit Madagascar within 12 hrs.</title>
<headline>Cyclone Gretelle to hit Madagascar within 12 hrs.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Gretelle, with 105 mph winds, is approaching the coast of Madagascar from the northeast, private forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Landfall is expected within 12 hours along the southeast coast.</p>
<p>High winds, a storm surge and very heavy rain will likely lead to significant damage.</p>
</text>
